    {
      "id": "serpiente",
      "fondo": "costa",
      "camara": {
        "de": 0,
        "a": 200,
        "zoom": [
          1,
          1.05
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Era una serpiente gigante, de quince metros de largo, con el cuerpo cubierto de oro.",
          "en": "It was a giant serpent, fifteen meters long, with a body covered in gold."
        },
        {
          "es": "Su barba era más larga que un brazo. Sus cejas eran de lapislázuli, una piedra de un azul profundo.",
          "en": "His beard was longer than a man's arm. His eyebrows were made of lapis lazuli, a deep blue stone."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se irguió y abrió la boca. El marinero se tiró al suelo, temblando.",
          "en": "He rose up and opened his mouth. The sailor threw himself on the ground, shaking."
        },
        {
          "es": "«¿Quién te trajo aquí, pequeño?», dijo la serpiente. «Habla, o te convertiré en cenizas.»",
          "en": "\"Who brought you here, little one?\" said the serpent. \"Speak, or I will turn you to ashes.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "El marinero estaba demasiado asustado para responder. Así que la serpiente lo tomó con suavidad en la boca.",
          "en": "The sailor was too frightened to answer. So the serpent gently picked him up in his mouth."
        },
        {
          "es": "Lo llevó a su hogar y lo dejó en el suelo. El marinero no tenía ni un rasguño.",
          "en": "He carried him home and set him down. The sailor did not have a single scratch."
        }
      ],
